        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Reinung nrian lou mei di khou Poubaomei rui",
            "Kamei nun ta lung dat diu khang ninga",
            "Poupei guaita zai pat lou dat the.",
            "",
            "Lumna piumei guai khang nade",
            "Nrianloumei Kanaan ram tei;",
            "Kachaek kaphut rui supui ram,",
            "Khou tei gut khang ai lunglai ni.",
            "",
            "5. Lumlou makmei Israel zatguai tei rui",
            "Pharaoh bang khou rui zai pat lou sini",
            "Poubaomei zauzian ta thailou mak.",
            "",
            "6. Zianmei nunta zaipat nimei zingbang khou tei",
            "Lauziu zei rui chaengmun khou tei lou na",
            "Kaniu ta Raguang rui kanlou the.",
            "",
            "7. Raguang rui kandi ta Heidi kam zianlouna",
            "Kana mpou ‘khat namei ta tilou;",
            "Kata lummei guai ring dat diu khang."
          ]
        }
      }
